iewed against the implemented\n  reporting capability by engineering — measured by recorded technical review\n  sign-off before publication.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- **HLR-4 (P2)**: \"Documentation covers report semantics (what counts as a\n  GPU-hour) and export integration\" — direct cover. Epic priority is P1 per\n  the docs-authoring priority exception (strategy priority Major → P1), not\n  inherited from HLR-4.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":46261,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b64fdb569a627dec","agent_id":"a4fb1e800e30ab2bc","session_id":"552a4708-ccc9-4336-802d-f1ef32ac46ea","uuid":"bb284312-0991-4adc-abcc-c52f2409786e","timestamp":"2026-10-26T16:27:40.553Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9018 strategy"}
