\n52\t  as delivered.\n53\t- **Administrator task flow**: viewing per-project consumption reports and\n54\t  the current-month consumption-versus-quota view in the Dashboard.\n55\t\n56\t## Acceptance Criteria\n57\t\n58\t- Documentation covers report semantics including an explicit definition of\n59\t  what counts as a GPU-hour, consistent with the metering data semantics as\n60\t  delivered — measured by review against the landed reporting and metering\n61\t  behavior.\n62\t- Export integration (CSV and reporting API) is documented for finance\n63\t  tooling consumers — measured by a reader being able to retrieve a report\n64\t  via CSV and the API using only the documentation.\n65\t- All documentation is technically reviewed against the implemented\n66\t  reporting capability by engineering — measured by recorded technical review\n67\t  sign-off before publication.\n68\t\n69\t## HLR Traceability\n70\t\n71\t- **HLR-4 (P2)**: \"Documentation covers report semantics (what counts as a\n72\t  GPU-hour) and export integration\" — direct cover. Epic priority is P1 per\n73\t  the docs-authoring priority exception (strategy priority Major → P1), not\n74\t  inherited from HLR-4.\n75\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9632d07af5dd8eab","agent_id":"ac1711a44088525e6","session_id":"552a4708-ccc9-4336-802d-f1ef32ac46ea","uuid":"81565e16-8b18-4e2b-af33-3ca6eab4e76e","timestamp":"2026-10-26T16:29:47.238Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-ae49e91e196e551a","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9018 decomposition"}
